{"id": "t148-002", "text": "Emily back from Lisbon. Flight home was delayed 6 hrs, she landed at 2am and went straight into work the next day. Mad. She said the trip itself was lovely though, rented a little flat in Alfama with her partner and did a day trip to Sintra. They're already talking about going back over the summer, maybe Porto this time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "2am"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next day", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t148-003", "text": "call w Naledi - her manager Ruth is leaving end of the month, Naledi might go for the role", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ruth", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "might go for the role", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t148-007", "text": "So Amy's audition for the conservatoire is on the 14th and she's been rehearsing nonstop. Her mum is flying over from Dublin the day before to go with her. Amy says she's fine but she was biting her nails the whole time we talked. I should send her something that morning, just a short message, nothing that piles on pressure.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition for the conservatoire", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying over from Dublin", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the whole time we talked"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t148-013", "text": "Kwame has started at the new firm, in-house legal team. Says the people are nice but the commute is brutal.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kwame", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in-house legal team", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "commute is brutal", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t148-016", "text": "remind me to email Ayesha's team lead about the handover before she goes on leave. She's away from the 3rd for two weeks", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "email Ayesha's team lead about the handover", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "team lead", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she goes on leave", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from the 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t148-017", "text": "Tiago had his MOT and driving lesson on the same morning lol. Lesson went fine, car failed", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MOT", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving lesson", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same morning", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t148-018", "text": "Louis said his sister Zofia got into the Royal Ballet School!! Starting in September. Whole family's going down for the first day", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Louis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the Royal Ballet School", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Starting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t148-019", "text": "Ethan in the lift: his manager is going on paternity leave sometime next month and Ethan is covering. Bit nervous about it, never managed people before. Should take him for a coffee the week after to see how it's going.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "paternity leave", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "covering", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Bit nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t148-022", "text": "Thabo's wedding anniversary is the 22nd. Ten years. Mariam (his wife) has planned a surprise trip to Cape Town, he doesn't know yet", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Ten years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise trip to Cape Town", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t148-025", "text": "ok so Siddharth got the promotion, senior architect from next month, he's buzzing. His boss told him on Monday and he wasn't allowed to say anything until the announcement this afternoon. Need to organise drinks for him sometime next week, check with Duc which day works because Duc's away the Thursday. Maybe the pub by the station.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "senior architect", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from next month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "buzzing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this afternoon"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "organise drinks for him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check with Duc which day works", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Thursday", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t148-026", "text": "ming - allergic to shellfish, remember for the team dinner", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "ming", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to shellfish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "remember", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "team dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t148-027", "text": "Spoke to Pedro after his test. He failed on a roundabout, gutted. Rebooking for early December. Check in with him at the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Rebooking", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early December", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t148-029", "text": "voice note: right so Naledi called, she had the interview with the client side this morning, thinks it went okay, they said they'd let her know by the end of the week. Also her flatmate's cat Pepper had kittens, five of them, she's keeping one. Remind me to ask her about the job on Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview with the client side", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the week"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pepper", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had kittens", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her about the job", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t148-034", "text": "Milan says the client from Rotterdam is a nightmare, keeps changing the brief. Mtg w them again early next month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "client from Rotterdam is a nightmare", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Mtg", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t148-036", "text": "Demi back from Lagos. Wedding was huge, 600 people. She's jetlagged and has to be back in court the next morning", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Demi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back from Lagos", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "jetlagged", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the next morning", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t148-041", "text": "Ayesha resigned today. Last day is end of the month, then she's going travelling in South America for six months, starting in Lima and ending up in Patagonia. Her boyfriend Louis is quitting too and going with her. Leaving do sometime the week before. Don't forget to get a card going round the team for her, and maybe a decent travel backpack as a group present.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayesha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "resigned", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Last day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going travelling in South America", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "six months", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Louis", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quitting", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime the week before", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card going round the team for her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "a decent travel backpack as a group present", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t148-042", "text": "tiago fernández - new starter in accounts, from Porto, plays 5 a side", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "tiago fernández", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "accounts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Porto", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "5 a side", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t148-043", "text": "Louis said Zofia was really homesick in her first few weeks. Seems to be settling in now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Louis", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in her first few weeks"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "settling in", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "now"}]}
{"id": "t148-045", "text": "Leah's back at work. Quiet. Told me she's struggling to sleep since the funeral.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling to sleep", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t148-049", "text": "Dong is learning Spanish on Duolingo, 200 day streak. Going to Mexico City sometime next year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Spanish", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "200 day streak", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Going to Mexico City", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next year", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t148-050", "text": "Siddharth told me Duc has been really down since the restructure. Losing his whole team end of the month. Don't forget to check in with him on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Duc", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "down", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "restructure", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Losing his whole team", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t148-053", "text": "Pedro said his girlfriend Kiri has the final round of her law firm interviews early next week. Two days of assessments, then a partner interview the day after. She's terrified about the group exercise. I should text her the morning of the first day, and maybe ask Pedro the week after if she's heard anything back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kiri", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final round of her law firm interviews", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Two days", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "partner interview", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified about the group exercise", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of the first day", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Pedro the week after if she's heard anything back", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Pedro", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t148-055", "text": "Sam - hates flying, takes a sleeping pill on anything over 3 hours", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates flying", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "takes a sleeping pill on anything over 3 hours", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t148-058", "text": "Chioma had the baby! Little girl, born Tuesday night. Sean's on leave until the end of the month. Must get a gift for them, maybe the cot mobile she mentioned.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Little girl", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sean", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leave", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a gift for them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cot mobile she mentioned", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t148-059", "text": "Malik's moving to Bristol with his partner sometime in the spring, his partner got a job at the university there. He'll go remote, his manager's already signed it off. They're viewing flats the weekend after next. He's a bit anxious about leaving his mates and his football team behind, but says it's the right call.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the university", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "go remote", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing flats", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after next", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mates", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "football team", "owner": "p1"}]}
